## What Inkwell is

A personal task system built on PAI that replaces Nick's paper notebook for the things paper can't do (search, cross-project context, agent review, mobile capture, cross-day persistence) while preserving what paper does best (zero-friction capture, always-visible page, fast reorder, satisfying "done"). Single-user, multi-front (career pivot, AccessBuddy, LIMSOC, LifesaverOnCall, LSV Comms, SMLSC, Personal, PAI Tooling, Life OS Console). The agent is a first-class participant, not a UI nicety.

The notebook is not a constraint — it is a **hypothesis to beat in a 14-day bake-off**. If Inkwell does not beat paper in two weeks, the project dies and the notebook wins.

